<title>SPAIN: Spain car sales up 6.89 pct in May - Anfac.</title>
<headline>Spain car sales up 6.89 pct in May - Anfac.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish car sales in May totalled 88,412 , a rise of 6.89 percent versus the same month of 1996, provisional data from carmakers' association Anfac showed on Friday.</p>
<p>In the first four months, total cars sales reached 416,983, 9.01 percent up from the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
